Comment: 0,0:21:45.62,0:21:54.03,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,0)\blur1}能從你呼吸的律動感覺得到哦
Comment: 0,0:21:54.03,0:21:56.71,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}真是溫暖啊
Comment: 0,0:21:56.71,0:22:06.63,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,350)\blur1}珍惜的日常生活就在這裡
Comment: 0,0:22:13.69,0:22:20.84,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,0)\blur1}你知道嗎  你試圖藉由依偎傳達心意
Comment: 0,0:22:20.84,0:22:26.55,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}你笨拙的那點  我很喜歡哦
Comment: 0,0:22:26.55,0:22:33.51,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,350)\blur1}我現在一定很幸福
Comment: 0,0:22:34.08,0:22:41.04,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,0)\blur1}在誰也無法知曉的命運牢籠中
Comment: 0,0:22:41.04,0:22:43.73,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}Behind you
Comment: 0,0:22:43.73,0:22:48.13,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}笑著並稍微落淚
Comment: 0,0:22:48.13,0:22:51.87,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}我的存在意義
Comment: 0,0:22:51.87,0:22:58.66,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,350)\blur1}將由你的雙手重新塑造
Comment: 0,0:23:00.55,0:23:04.29,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,350)\blur1}你看  你看  對吧？
Comment: 0,0:23:08.60,0:23:12.15,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}最喜歡你了
Comment: 0,0:23:12.15,0:23:15.68,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1\c&H5AB5F4&}最喜歡你了
